__mtLangPack('zh','tuam',{"Slip into the water":"滑入水中","Wait for the tide":"等待潮水","LAGOON ←":"泻湖 ←","→ OCEAN":"→ 大洋","No! An outgoing current would carry you out to sea. Watch the dolphins jump in the waves instead.":"不行！退潮的水流会把你带到外海。还是看看海豚在浪里跳跃吧。","The tide turns: now the current flows into the lagoon.":"潮水转向了：现在水流流进泻湖。","On a motu of Rangiroa, vines grow in coral sand among the coconut palms: grapes from an atoll! There are two harvests a year, in May and November. <b>Pick only the ripe, dark bunches.</b>":"在 Rangiroa 的一个 motu 上，葡萄藤在椰子树间的珊瑚沙中生长：来自环礁的葡萄！每年收获两次，分别在五月和十一月。<b>只摘成熟、颜色深的葡萄串。</b>","Sweet and ripe.":"甜，熟透了。","Load the boat to Avatoru":"装船运往 Avatoru","Your grapes cross the lagoon by boat to the winery in Avatoru. The first vines were planted on Rangiroa in {#1}, in coral soil where no other vineyard grows.":"你的葡萄乘船穿过泻湖，运到 Avatoru 的酿酒厂。Rangiroa 的第一批葡萄藤种于 {#1} 年，种在没有其他葡萄园生长的珊瑚土壤里。","Hold to breathe in":"按住吸气","Breathe in…":"吸气……","Breathe out… bubbles rise.":"呼气……气泡往上升。","A big shark glides past, close. What do you do?":"一条大鲨鱼从你身边很近的地方游过。你会怎么做？","Reach out and touch it":"伸手摸它","Yes. Grey reef sharks are not interested in divers who keep calm. Never touch or chase them.":"对。灰礁鲨对保持冷静的潜水者不感兴趣。绝不要触摸或追逐它们。","Pearl oysters, <i>Pinctada margaritifera</i>, the black-lip oyster, hang on lines in the lagoon. <b>{#1}. Pull up a line</b> and clean the shells.":"珍珠贝 <i>Pinctada margaritifera</i>，即黑唇珍珠贝，挂在泻湖里的绳子上。<b>{#1}. 拉起一根绳子</b>，清洗贝壳。","Pull up the line":"拉起绳子","<b>{#1}. Scrape off</b> the little shells and seaweed that grow on the oyster.":"<b>{#1}. 刮掉</b>长在珍珠贝上的小贝壳和海藻。","Hold to open":"按住打开","Now, quickly: a skilled grafter places a <b>round bead</b> of shell, then beside it a <b>tiny square of mantle</b> from another oyster. The mantle gives the pearl its colour.":"现在，动作要快：熟练的插核师放入一颗贝壳磨成的<b>圆形珠核</b>，再在旁边放一<b>小方块外套膜</b>，取自另一只珍珠贝。外套膜决定珍珠的颜色。","Place the bead":"放入珠核","Place the mantle":"放入外套膜","<b>{#1}. Back into the lagoon.</b> The oyster coats the bead with nacre, layer after layer…":"<b>{#1}. 放回泻湖。</b>珍珠贝一层又一层地用珍珠质包裹珠核……","<b>{#1} to {#2} months later:</b> a <b>black</b> pearl! It joins your pearl line in the faʻaʻapu.":"<b>{#1} 到 {#2} 个月后：</b>一颗<b>黑</b>珍珠！它加入了你 faʻaʻapu 里的珍珠串。","On Tikehau, coconuts are dried into <b>copra</b>, still one of the main incomes of the Tuamotu. <b>{#1}. Gather the fallen coconuts.</b>":"在 Tikehau，椰子被晒成<b>椰干</b>，至今仍是 Tuamotu 的主要收入之一。<b>{#1}. 捡起掉落的椰子。</b>","<b>{#1}. Split each coconut in half</b> with the axe, then lay the halves on the rack, white flesh up to the sun.":"<b>{#1}. 用斧头把每个椰子劈成两半</b>，然后把半个椰子摆到架子上，白色椰肉朝上晒太阳。","Split and lay out":"劈开并摆好","<b>{#1}. Two days in the sun.</b> The flesh shrinks away from the shell.":"<b>{#1}. 晒两天太阳。</b>椰肉会收缩，与壳分离。","<b>{#1}. Scoop out the flesh</b> with the curved tool, and let it dry three to five more days.":"<b>{#1}. 用弯刀具挖出椰肉</b>，再晒三到五天。","<b>{#1}. Bag it, weigh it,</b> and carry it to the quay: the cargo schooner takes it to Tahiti.":"<b>{#1}. 装袋、称重，</b>再运到码头：货运帆船会把它运到 Tahiti。","A coconut grove on Tikehau with a copra drying rack":"Tikehau 的一片椰林，有一个晒椰干的架子","Your copra sails to Tahiti on the schooner. There it is pressed into coconut oil, used for monoï and soap. Copra is a big part of what the cargo ships carry back from the Tuamotu.":"你的椰干搭上货运帆船驶向 Tahiti。在那里，它会被压榨成椰子油，用来制作 monoï 和肥皂。椰干是货船从 Tuamotu 运回的主要货物之一。","Back it goes, to grow for years.":"放回去吧，让它再长几年。","Grey reef shark":"灰礁鲨","Spotted eagle ray":"斑点鹰鳐","Bottlenose dolphin":"宽吻海豚","The Tiputa pass of Rangiroa":"Rangiroa 的 Tiputa 水道","The current flows out toward the ocean.":"水流正向大洋流出。","And you knew when not to go in.":"而且你知道什么时候不该下水。","You drifted through Tiputa pass and met {A}.{B} Since 2006 all of French Polynesia has been a sanctuary for sharks.":"你随流漂过 Tiputa 水道，遇见了{A}。{B} 自 2006 年起，整个法属波利尼西亚都成了鲨鱼保护区。","Rows of vines on the coral sand of a motu, among coconut palms":"motu 的珊瑚沙上一排排葡萄藤，生长在椰子树之间","Still green and sour: leave it for later.":"还是绿的，很酸：留着以后再摘。","A heavy bunch!":"好重的一串！","The south pass of Fakarava, with grey reef sharks hanging in the current":"Fakarava 的南水道，灰礁鲨悬停在水流中","Too long! Breathe out slowly.":"太久了！慢慢呼气。","And tonight, under the full moon of the season, thousands of groupers gathered to spawn!":"今晚，在这个季节的满月下，成千上万条石斑鱼聚集在一起产卵！","Around the full moon of June and July, thousands of marbled groupers also gather here to spawn.":"在六月和七月的满月前后，成千上万条清水石斑鱼也会聚集到这里产卵。","You stayed calm in the wall of sharks of Fakarava.{A} The pass is protected, inside a UNESCO biosphere reserve.":"你在 Fakarava 的鲨鱼墙中保持了冷静。{A} 这条水道受到保护，位于联合国教科文组织生物圈保护区内。","A pearl farm on stilts over the lagoon of Fakarava":"Fakarava 泻湖上一座建在高脚桩上的珍珠养殖场","Not open enough to work.":"开口不够大，没法操作。","Too wide! Let it close and rest, then try again gently.":"开得太大了！让它合上休息一下，再轻轻地试一次。","The bead goes in first.":"先放珠核。","<b>16 to 18 months later:</b> a <b>{A}</b> pearl! It joins your pearl line in the faʻaʻapu.":"<b>16 到 18 个月后：</b>一颗<b>{A}</b>珍珠！它加入了你 faʻaʻapu 里的珍珠串。","You grafted a black-lip oyster and harvested a {A} pearl. From a baby oyster to a pearl takes nearly four years. Pearl farms are private: visit only with the family that runs them. They give you a mother-of-pearl lure for your canoe.":"你为一只黑唇珍珠贝插了核，收获了一颗{A}珍珠。从幼贝到珍珠需要将近四年。珍珠养殖场是私人的：只能在经营它的家庭陪同下参观。他们送你一个珍珠母鱼饵，供你的独木舟使用。","Pull the cover":"拉开盖子","The Tiputa pass links the lagoon of Rangiroa to the ocean. Twice a day the current flows <b>in</b> (rising tide) and twice <b>out</b>. Drift snorkelling is only safe with a guide, a calm sea and an <b>incoming</b> current. Watch the current, then decide.":"Tiputa 水道连接着 Rangiroa 的泻湖和大洋。水流每天两次<b>流入</b>（涨潮），两次<b>流出</b>。只有在有向导、海面平静并且水流<b>流入</b>时，随流浮潜才是安全的。先观察水流，再做决定。","The boat drops you at the ocean end; you float with the current into the lagoon, your guide beside you. Don’t swim against it. <b>Tap each animal</b> to name it.":"小船把你送到靠大洋的一端；你随着水流漂进泻湖，向导就在你身边。不要逆流游泳。<b>点击每种动物</b>，说出它的名字。","At Fakarava’s south pass, hundreds of grey reef sharks hang in the incoming current. You hold on to a dead rock, still and calm. <b>Breathe slowly:</b> hold the button to breathe in, release to breathe out. The calmer you are, the closer the sharks come.":"在 Fakarava 的南水道，数百条灰礁鲨悬停在流入的水流中。你抓住一块死珊瑚石，保持安静和平稳。<b>慢慢呼吸：</b>按住按钮吸气，松开呼气。你越平静，鲨鱼就游得越近。","<b>{#1}. The graft.</b> Open the shell just a little with the wedge: too wide and the oyster is hurt. Release in the green zone.":"<b>{#1}. 插核。</b>用楔子把贝壳稍稍撬开一点：开得太大会伤到珍珠贝。在绿色区域松开。","Coconut crabs, <b>kaveu</b>, come out at night. With a family of Tikehau you count them: move the torch, tap a crab to measure it. The rule: only crabs with a body (thorax) over <b>{#1} mm</b> may be taken; small ones go back.":"椰子蟹 <b>kaveu</b> 在夜里出来活动。你和 Tikehau 的一家人一起数它们：移动手电筒，点击螃蟹来测量。规矩是：只有身体（胸甲）超过 <b>{#1} mm</b> 的螃蟹才能捕捉；小的要放回去。","Never: it stresses the shark and is dangerous for you.":"绝对不行：这会让鲨鱼紧张，对你也很危险。","<b>3. Dry in the sun…</b> but it is raining (<span>{A}</span>)! Wet copra goes mouldy. Pull the cover over the rack.":"<b>3. 在阳光下晒干……</b>可是下雨了（<span>{A}</span>）！湿椰干会发霉。把罩布拉过来盖住晾架。","A coconut grove at night on Tikehau; a torch beam searches among the roots":"夜晚 Tikehau 的椰子林；一道手电筒光束在树根间搜寻","You measured five kaveu{A}. Coconut crabs can live more than 60 years and weigh up to about 4 kg; rats eat the young ones, so islands without rats are their best refuge.":"你测量了五只 kaveu{A}。椰子蟹可以活 60 年以上，体重可达约 4 kg；老鼠会吃掉幼蟹，所以没有老鼠的岛屿是它们最好的避难所。","a pink foraminifera shell":"一个粉色的有孔虫壳","A foraminifera: a tiny single-celled sea creature that builds a shell of chambers. When it dies, its red-pink shell washes up and colours the beach.":"有孔虫：一种很小的单细胞海洋生物，会造出一个分成许多小室的壳。它死后，红粉色的壳被冲上岸，把海滩染上颜色。","a piece of coral":"一块珊瑚","A broken bit of coral skeleton, white and full of little cups where the polyps lived.":"一小块破碎的珊瑚骨骼，白白的，布满了小杯子一样的小孔，那是珊瑚虫住过的地方。","a bit of seashell":"一小片贝壳","A fragment of a seashell, worn smooth by the waves: you can still see its ridges.":"一片被海浪磨得光滑的贝壳碎片：你还能看到上面的纹路。","a sea-urchin spine":"一根海胆刺","A spine from a sea urchin, striped and hollow, broken off on the reef.":"一根海胆的刺，有条纹，中间是空的，是在礁石上折断的。","coral ground by a parrotfish":"被鹦嘴鱼磨碎的珊瑚","A round white grain of coral that a parrotfish bit off, ground up and passed out: much of the white sand of the islands is made this way.":"一颗圆圆的白色珊瑚颗粒：鹦嘴鱼把珊瑚咬下来、磨碎，再排出来。岛上的白沙很多就是这样形成的。","Pink sand under a magnifying lens":"放大镜下的粉红沙","Black basalt from volcanoes: Pointe Vénus on Tahiti, and the Marquesas":"来自火山的黑色玄武岩：塔希提岛的 Pointe Vénus，还有马克萨斯群岛","Coral and shells ground by the waves and by parrotfish: Bora Bora, Maupiti":"被海浪和鹦嘴鱼磨碎的珊瑚和贝壳：波拉波拉、Maupiti","Coral mixed with the red-pink shells of foraminifera: Tikehau, Rangiroa":"珊瑚混合着有孔虫的红粉色外壳：Tikehau、Rangiroa","Green olivine crystals from lava: Papakōlea in Hawaiʻi. There is no green-sand beach in French Polynesia":"来自熔岩的绿色橄榄石晶体：夏威夷的 Papakōlea。法属波利尼西亚没有绿沙滩","<b>Four jars of sand from four beaches.</b> Where does jar {A}, the <b>{B}</b> sand, come from?":"<b>四个海滩的四罐沙子。</b>{A} 号罐子里的<b>{B}</b>色的沙来自哪里？","Look at the colour again: what could make it?":"再看看颜色：是什么让它变成这样的？","Every beach is different, because each is made of what the island and its reef give.":"每一片海滩都不一样，因为每片海滩都是由它的岛屿和礁石给予的东西组成的。","The pink sand is so beautiful. You would like to take some home…":"粉红色的沙子真美。你很想带一些回家……","Leave it on the beach and take a photo instead":"把它留在海滩上，拍张照片就好","Yes. Every grain took years to make, and beaches already lose sand to storms. Leave the sand, the shells and the coral where they are.":"对。每一粒沙都要花好多年才能形成，而海滩已经因为风暴失去了不少沙子。把沙子、贝壳和珊瑚都留在原处吧。","Fill a small bottle: nobody will notice":"装满一小瓶：没人会发现的","If every visitor took a bottle, the pink would fade from the beach. Leave it there.":"如果每位游客都带走一瓶，海滩上的粉红色就会褪去。把它留在那里吧。","Take a bag for all your friends":"给所有朋友各装一袋","Never: the sand belongs to the beach and to the island.":"绝对不行：沙子属于海滩，也属于这座岛屿。","You saw what pink sand is made of: coral, shells, sea-urchin spines, grains ground by parrotfish and, above all, the red-pink shells of foraminifera. White sand is coral and shell, black sand is volcanic basalt, and green sand, on Papakōlea in Hawaiʻi, is olivine.":"你看到了粉红沙是由什么组成的：珊瑚、贝壳、海胆刺、被鹦嘴鱼磨碎的颗粒，最重要的是有孔虫的红粉色外壳。白沙是珊瑚和贝壳，黑沙是火山玄武岩，而夏威夷 Papakōlea 的绿沙是橄榄石。","<b>Four jars of sand from four beaches.</b> Where does jar {#1}, the <b>black</b> sand, come from?":"<b>四个海滩的四罐沙子。</b>{#1} 号罐子里的<b>黑</b>色的沙来自哪里？","<b>Four jars of sand from four beaches.</b> Where does jar {#1}, the <b>white</b> sand, come from?":"<b>四个海滩的四罐沙子。</b>{#1} 号罐子里的<b>白</b>色的沙来自哪里？","<b>Four jars of sand from four beaches.</b> Where does jar {#1}, the <b>pink</b> sand, come from?":"<b>四个海滩的四罐沙子。</b>{#1} 号罐子里的<b>粉</b>色的沙来自哪里？","<b>Four jars of sand from four beaches.</b> Where does jar {#1}, the <b>green</b> sand, come from?":"<b>四个海滩的四罐沙子。</b>{#1} 号罐子里的<b>绿</b>色的沙来自哪里？","Current: flowing IN":"水流：流入","Current: flowing OUT":"水流：流出","Released: the family already has enough.":"已放生：这家人已经够吃了。","The sand of Tikehau is pink. Why? <b>Hold the wooden handle</b> (or the rim) to slide the lens over the sand, and <b>tap</b> what you see inside it: five different things make up this beach.":"Tikehau 的沙子是粉色的。为什么？<b>按住木柄</b>（或镜框）在沙子上移动放大镜，然后<b>点击</b>你在镜中看到的东西：这片海滩由五种不同的东西组成。","small, round, almost black berries in a tight bunch":"果粒小而圆，几乎是黑色，紧紧挤成一串","almost black":"几乎是黑色","red-purple berries, a little looser":"红紫色的果粒，果串稍松一些","large oval blue-black berries with a pale bloom":"果粒大而椭圆，蓝黑色，表面有一层浅色果粉","blue-black with a pale bloom":"蓝黑色并带有浅色果粉","big oval golden berries: a table grape, ripe when it turns amber":"果粒大而椭圆，金黄色：这是鲜食葡萄，变成琥珀色时就成熟了","Cut above bud {C}":"在第 {C} 个芽上方剪","Rows of vines in the coral sand of a motu of Rangiroa, sheltered by coconut palms, papaya and tiare":"Rangiroa 一座 motu 的珊瑚沙上一排排葡萄藤，四周有椰子树、木瓜树和 tiare 遮挡","<b>{#1}. Prune.</b> On the atoll there is no winter to rest the vines: the grower prunes them, and the cut makes the vine start a new cycle. That is why Rangiroa has <b>two harvests a year</b>. <b>Cut each cane just above the second bud</b> from the old wood.":"<b>{#1}. 修剪。</b>环礁上没有冬天让葡萄藤休眠：种植者修剪它们，剪口会让葡萄藤开始新的生长周期。所以 Rangiroa <b>一年有两次收获</b>。<b>在每根枝条上，从老枝算起的第二个芽上方剪断</b>。","Clean cut: two buds will make two shoots, and each shoot its grapes.":"剪得好：两个芽会长出两根新梢，每根新梢都会结出葡萄。","Too short: with only one bud the vine has too little to start again.":"太短了：只有一个芽，葡萄藤没有足够的力气重新生长。","Too long: {A} buds would spread the vine’s strength over too many small bunches.":"太长了：{A} 个芽会把葡萄藤的力气分散到太多小串葡萄上。","<b>{#1}. The buds burst.</b> In the warm sun the shoots climb toward the top wire in a few weeks.":"<b>{#1}. 发芽。</b>在温暖的阳光下，几周内新梢就会爬到最上面的铁丝。","<b>A trade wind from the ocean</b> carries salt spray over the motu. Salt burns young vine leaves. What protects these vines?":"<b>一阵来自大洋的信风</b>把咸咸的海雾吹过 motu。盐分会灼伤葡萄藤的嫩叶。是什么保护着这些葡萄藤？","The hedge of coconut palms, papaya and tiare around the vineyard":"葡萄园四周由椰子树、木瓜树和 tiare 组成的防风树篱","A plastic sheet over every vine":"每株葡萄藤上都盖一块塑料布","Nothing: salt makes the grapes taste of the sea":"什么都没有：盐会让葡萄带上大海的味道","The vines need sun and air: under plastic they would cook and rot.":"葡萄藤需要阳光和空气：盖在塑料布下会被闷熟、烂掉。","Salt dries the leaves and the plant suffers: the grapes would not ripen.":"盐会让叶子变干，植株受损：葡萄就无法成熟了。","<b>{#1}. Water.</b> There is no river on an atoll. A well dug at the lowest point of the plot reaches the fresh water that floats under the motu, and a <b>drip line</b> gives each vine a little water at its foot. Pump, then open the line.":"<b>{#1}. 浇水。</b>环礁上没有河流。在地块最低处挖一口井，就能取到浮在 motu 地下的淡水，再用<b>滴灌管</b>给每株葡萄藤的根部一点点水。先抽水，再打开滴灌管。","Pump the well":"从井里抽水","Open the drip line":"打开滴灌管","Drop by drop, the water goes straight to the roots, and none is wasted.":"一滴一滴，水直接流到根部，一点都不浪费。","<b>{#1}. About five months after pruning, the harvest.</b> Four grape varieties grow here. <b>Pick only the ripe bunches</b>; green ones stay for later.":"<b>{#1}. 修剪后大约五个月，就到收获的时候了。</b>这里种着四个葡萄品种。<b>只摘成熟的果串</b>；青的留着以后再摘。","Italia is still pale green and hard: it is ripe when it turns golden amber.":"意大利亚还是浅绿色、硬硬的：变成金黄的琥珀色时才成熟。","Still green and sour: {A} is ripe when its berries turn {B}.":"还是青的，很酸：{A} 的果粒变成{B}时才成熟。",": {B}. Into the crate.":"：{B}。放进箱子。","Carry the crates to the boat":"把箱子搬到船上","The crates go into a small boat at the motu. The grapes cross the lagoon to the winery in <b>Avatoru</b>, where they are pressed the same day.":"箱子被装上停在 motu 边的小船。葡萄穿过泻湖，运到 <b>Avatoru</b> 的酿酒厂，当天就会压榨。","You pruned to two buds, sheltered the vines from the salt behind palms, papaya and tiare, watered them drop by drop from the well, and picked ripe Carignan, Grenache, Muscat de Hambourg and Italia. On Rangiroa, vines grow in coral sand, in a vineyard reached only by boat.":"你把枝条修剪到两个芽，让葡萄藤躲在椰子树、木瓜树和 tiare 后面避开盐分，用井水一滴一滴地浇灌，还摘下了成熟的佳丽酿、歌海娜、汉堡麝香和意大利亚。在 Rangiroa，葡萄藤长在珊瑚沙里，这片葡萄园只能坐船到达。","black tips on the dorsal fin and the tail, and a pale band along the flank":"背鳍和尾鳍末端是黑色的，体侧有一条浅色条带","Look at the fin tips: are they black?":"看看鳍的末端：是黑色的吗？","a broad black edge all along the tail. In summer dozens hang in the incoming current at the mouth of the pass":"整个尾鳍后缘有一道宽宽的黑边。夏天会有几十条停在水道口的涨潮流中","Look at the tail: a black edge runs all along it.":"看看尾巴：整条后缘都有黑边。","Great hammerhead":"无沟双髻鲨","a flat, wide head and a very tall sickle-shaped dorsal fin. It comes mostly from December to April and is critically endangered":"头部扁平宽大，背鳍非常高，呈镰刀形。它主要在 12 月到 4 月出现，属于极危物种","Look at the head and the very tall dorsal fin.":"看看头部和非常高的背鳍。","pointed wings, a dark back covered in white rings and dots, and a very long tail. Groups gather from December to April":"翼尖尖的，深色的背上布满白色的圆环和斑点，尾巴非常长。12 月到 4 月会成群聚集","Look at the white spots and the long whip tail.":"看看白色斑点和像鞭子一样的长尾巴。","a bump on the forehead, thick lips and dark lines behind the eye. It can grow to {#1} m and is protected":"额头有个隆起，嘴唇厚厚的，眼睛后面有深色线纹。它可以长到 {#1} 米，是受保护物种","Look at the forehead bump and the thick lips.":"看看额头的隆起和厚嘴唇。","Orangespine unicornfish":"颊吻鼻鱼","orange lips, a yellow band to the eye and two bright orange spines at the base of the tail. They swim in schools":"橙色的嘴唇，一条黄色条带延伸到眼睛，尾柄处有两根鲜橙色的棘。它们成群游动","Look near the tail: two bright orange spines.":"看看尾巴附近：有两根鲜橙色的棘。","a smooth brown shell with radiating streaks, and one pair of scales between the eyes":"光滑的棕色龟壳上有放射状条纹，两眼之间有一对鳞片","Look at the shell and the flippers.":"看看龟壳和鳍状肢。","a short, thick beak, a tall curved dorsal fin and a plain grey back. A group lives in the pass all year":"吻部短而粗，背鳍高而弯，背部是纯灰色。有一群全年都生活在水道里","Look at the short beak and the tall curved fin.":"看看短短的吻部和高高的弯背鳍。","Whitetip reef shark":"灰三齿鲨","Tiger shark":"鼬鲨","Reef manta ray":"阿氏前口蝠鲼","Pink whipray":"粉红魟","Giant trevally":"浪人鲹","Achilles tang":"鳃斑刺尾鱼","Hawksbill turtle":"玳瑁","OCEAN":"大洋","Current: flowing IN, toward the lagoon":"海流：流入，流向泻湖","Current: flowing OUT, toward the ocean":"海流：流出，流向大洋","A licensed guide":"一位持证向导","A calm sea":"平静的海面","An incoming current":"涨潮流（流入的海流）","From the lookout at <b>Tiputa</b> you watch the pass that links the lagoon of Rangiroa to the ocean. Four times a day the current turns: <b>in</b> on the rising tide, <b>out</b> on the falling tide. A drift is only for an <b>incoming</b> current, a calm sea, and always with a guide.":"你在 <b>Tiputa</b> 的观景台上，望着连接 Rangiroa 泻湖和大洋的水道。海流一天转向四次：涨潮时<b>流入</b>，落潮时<b>流出</b>。只有在<b>流入</b>的海流、平静的海面下才能漂流，而且一定要有向导陪同。","No! An outgoing current would carry you out to the open ocean. Look: the dolphins are surfing the waves it makes at the mouth of the pass.":"不行！流出的海流会把你带到外海。看：海豚正在水道口冲它掀起的浪。","The tide turns: now the ocean flows into the lagoon. The boats go out.":"潮水转向了：现在大洋的海水流进泻湖。船出发了。","The current flows out toward the ocean: no drift now.":"海流正流向大洋：现在不能漂流。","The boat drops you at the ocean end of the pass. You roll in backwards, your guide beside you, and the incoming current carries you into the lagoon: <b>don’t swim against it</b>, just float and look. <b>Tap an animal</b> to name it.":"船把你送到水道靠大洋的一端。你背朝后翻身入水，向导就在你身边，流入的海流带着你漂向泻湖：<b>不要逆流游</b>，只要漂浮着观看。<b>点击一种动物</b>说出它的名字。","Your dive slate":"你的潜水记录板","A sea animal":"一种海洋动物","Yes: {A}, again.":"对：{A}，又见到了。","Your guide points at it. What is it?":"你的向导指着它。这是什么？","Not this one. {A}":"不是这个。{A}","Float and look: the current does the work. <b>Tap an animal</b> to name it.":"漂浮着观看：海流会帮你前进。<b>点击一种动物</b>说出它的名字。","Stay calm and float: let them choose how close to come":"保持冷静，漂浮着：让它们自己决定靠多近","Swim after them to stay close":"追着它们游，好靠近一点","Reach out to touch one":"伸手去摸一只","<b>{A}!</b> Three of them turn and come toward you. What do you do?":"<b>{A}！</b>有三只转过身朝你游来。你会怎么做？","Chasing them would scare them, and you would fight the current. Float still.":"追赶会吓到它们，而且你还得逆着海流游。静静地漂浮吧。","Never touch wild dolphins: it can stress them and spread disease. Let them come and go.":"绝对不要触摸野生海豚：这会让它们紧张，还会传播疾病。让它们自由来去。","{B}. You stayed calm, so they stayed a moment longer.":"{B}。你保持了冷静，所以它们多停留了一会儿。","The current slows as the pass opens into the lagoon. You reach the <b>Aquarium</b>, a coral garden inside the lagoon, and the boat picks you up.":"水道通向泻湖，海流渐渐变慢。你来到了<b>水族馆（Aquarium）</b>，这是泻湖里的一座珊瑚园，船在这里接你上来。","You drifted through Tiputa pass and named {A}.{B} French Polynesia has protected all sharks since 2006, and the pass is recognised as an important area for sharks and rays.":"你漂流穿过了 Tiputa 水道，认出了 {A}。{B} 法属波利尼西亚自 2006 年起保护所有鲨鱼，这条水道也被认定为鲨鱼和鳐鱼的重要栖息区域。","The south pass of Fakarava: a wall of grey reef sharks hangs in the incoming current above the reef":"Fakarava 的南水道：一大群灰礁鲨悬停在礁石上方的涨潮水流中","You drop to the edge of Fakarava’s south pass. The incoming current is strong: divers hold their place with a <b>reef hook</b> on a short line. <b>Where do you set it?</b> Tap a spot on the reef.":"你下潜到 Fakarava 南水道的边缘。涨潮的水流很强：潜水员用一根短绳系着<b>礁钩</b>来稳住位置。<b>你要把它挂在哪里？</b>点击礁石上的一个位置。","A dead rock":"一块死礁石","A live coral":"一片活珊瑚","Not on living coral: the hook would break it, and it took decades to grow. Find a bare, dead rock.":"不能挂在活珊瑚上：钩子会把它弄断，而它要长几十年。找一块光秃秃的死礁石吧。","Hooked to a dead rock. Now let the current hold you, and breathe.":"已挂在死礁石上。现在让水流托住你，慢慢呼吸。","<b>Breathe slowly.</b> Follow the ring around your manu: <b>hold</b> the button while it grows (breathe in), <b>let go</b> while it shrinks (breathe out). The calmer you are, the closer the sharks come.":"<b>慢慢呼吸。</b>跟着你的 manu 周围的圆环：圆环变大时<b>按住</b>按钮（吸气），圆环变小时<b>松开</b>（慢慢呼气）。你越平静，鲨鱼就游得越近。","Breathing in…":"正在吸气……","The ring grows: breathe in now.":"圆环在变大：现在吸气。","The ring shrinks: let go and breathe out slowly.":"圆环在变小：松开，慢慢呼气。","Calm and slow. The sharks are coming closer.":"平静又缓慢。鲨鱼游得更近了。","Let go of the hook to follow it":"松开钩子去追它","No: the current would sweep you away from your group. Stay hooked, still and calm.":"不行：水流会把你冲离你的队伍。挂好钩子，保持不动、保持平静。","Around the full moon of June and July, thousands of camouflage groupers also gather here to spawn.":"在六月和七月的满月前后，成千上万的清水石斑鱼也会聚集到这里产卵。","You stayed calm in the wall of sharks of Fakarava, hooked to a dead rock and not to living coral.{A} The pass is protected, inside a UNESCO biosphere reserve.":"你在 Fakarava 的鲨鱼墙中保持了平静，把钩子挂在死礁石上，而不是活珊瑚上。{A}这条水道受到保护，位于联合国教科文组织的生物圈保护区内。","A pearl farm on stilts over the lagoon of Fakarava, with long lines of oysters under the surface":"Fakarava 泻湖上一座建在高脚桩上的珍珠养殖场，水面下挂着一长排一长排的珍珠贝","Black-lip oysters, <i>Pinctada margaritifera</i>, hang under a long line of floats. Each young oyster was drilled near the hinge and tied on a rope: a <b>chaplet</b>. <b>{#1}. Hold to haul up a chaplet</b> into the boat.":"黑唇珍珠贝（<i>Pinctada margaritifera</i>）挂在一长排浮标下面。每只幼贝都在铰合部附近钻了孔，系在一根绳子上：这就是<b>贝串</b>。<b>{#1}. 按住，把一串贝串拉上</b>船。","Hold to haul up":"按住拉起","<b>{#1}. Clean the oysters.</b> In a few months seaweed, sponges and little shells grow on them and steal their food. <b>Slide your finger</b> over the oysters: the water jet washes them clean.":"<b>{#1}. 清洗珍珠贝。</b>几个月后，海藻、海绵和小贝壳会长在它们身上，抢走它们的食物。<b>用手指滑过</b>珍珠贝：水柱会把它们冲干净。","<b>{#1}. The graft</b>, after about two years in the lagoon. First <b>open the shell a little</b> with the wedge: too wide and the oyster is hurt. Release in the green zone.":"<b>{#1}. 植核</b>，在泻湖里养了大约两年之后。先用楔子<b>把贝壳撬开一点</b>：开得太大会伤到珍珠贝。在绿色区域松开。","Make a tiny cut into the gonad":"在性腺上切一个小口","The gonad is the pale, soft part. A tiny cut opens a pocket for the bead.":"性腺是浅色、柔软的部分。切一个小口，为珠核打开一个小囊。","Slip in the bead":"放入珠核","The bead is a round piece of shell from a freshwater mussel. The oyster will cover it with nacre.":"珠核是用淡水蚌的贝壳做成的圆珠。珍珠贝会用珍珠层把它包裹起来。","Lay the graft against the bead":"把外套膜小片贴在珠核上","A graft of about {#1} mm² cut from the mantle of a donor oyster with beautiful nacre: it gives the pearl its colour.":"外套膜小片约 {#1} mm²，取自一只珍珠层很漂亮的供体贝的外套膜：它决定珍珠的颜色。","The shell stays open on its wedge. Now, gently and quickly, in the right order:":"贝壳靠楔子撑开着。现在，轻柔而迅速地按正确的顺序操作：","First open a pocket for the bead: the little cut.":"先为珠核打开一个小囊：切那个小口。","The bead goes in first, then the graft against it.":"先放珠核，再把外套膜小片贴在它旁边。","Now the graft.":"现在放外套膜小片。","<b>{#1}. Back into the lagoon.</b> A pearl sac forms around the bead in about a month; then the oyster lays nacre on it, thin layer after thin layer. A pearl needs at least <b>{#2} mm</b> of nacre.":"<b>{#1}. 放回泻湖。</b>大约一个月后，珠核周围会形成珍珠囊；然后珍珠贝在上面一层一层地分泌薄薄的珍珠层。一颗珍珠至少需要 <b>{#2} mm</b> 厚的珍珠层。","Which one is grade A?":"哪一颗是 A 级？","<b>5. Eighteen months later, the harvest!</b> Your oyster made a <b>{A}</b> pearl. The farm sorts pearls by size, shape, surface and <b>lustre</b>. Tap the pearl that is <b>grade A</b>: an almost perfect surface and a bright, mirror-like lustre.":"<b>5. 十八个月后，收获啦！</b>你的珍珠贝产出了一颗<b>{A}</b>珍珠。养殖场按大小、形状、表面和<b>光泽</b>给珍珠分级。点击 <b>A 级</b>的那颗珍珠：表面几乎完美，光泽明亮如镜。","Close, but look at the small spot and the duller lustre: that is grade B.":"很接近了，但看看那个小斑点和较暗的光泽：这是 B 级。","Rings and several spots: grade C or D.":"有环纹和好几个斑点：C 级或 D 级。","Yes: grade A, clean and shining like a mirror.":"没错：A 级，表面干净，亮得像镜子。","You hauled up a chaplet, washed the oysters, grafted one with a bead and a graft of mantle, and 18 months later harvested a {A} pearl. From a baby oyster to a pearl takes nearly four years. Pearl farms are private: visit only with the family that runs them. They give you a mother-of-pearl lure for your canoe.":"你拉起了一串贝串，清洗了珍珠贝，用珠核和外套膜小片给一只贝植了核，18 个月后收获了一颗{A}珍珠。从幼贝到珍珠要将近四年。珍珠养殖场是私人的：只能跟着经营它的家庭一起参观。他们送你一个珍珠母鱼饵，给你的独木舟用。","◀ Left":"◀ 左","pearl!":"珍珠！","A local guide walks you through what is left of the phosphate years at <b>Vaitepaua</b> and the port of <b>Temao</b>. <b>Tap the six remains</b> to hear their story. Stay on the path: the old holes are deep.":"一位本地向导带你走过 <b>Vaitepaua</b> 和 <b>Temao</b> 港的磷矿岁月遗迹。<b>点击六处遗迹</b>，听听它们的故事。请走在小路上：旧矿坑很深。","Your guide points across the plateau, full of holes and ferns. How do you cross it?":"你的向导指着布满坑洞和蕨类的台地。你要怎么穿过去？","On the marked path, behind the guide":"走标记好的小路，跟在向导后面","Straight across, it is shorter":"直接穿过去，这样更近","Jumping from pillar to pillar":"在岩柱之间跳来跳去","Yes. Some holes are about {#1} m deep and hidden by plants: never cross the mined plateau alone.":"没错。有些坑约 {#1} 米深，还被植物遮住了：千万不要独自穿越被开采过的台地。","You walked through the phosphate years of Makatea: the rails and the crane of Temao, the bakery of Vaitepaua, the holes and the deep water. Mined by hand from the {#1}s to {#2}, a third of the island was never restored; in {#3} the government agreed to study a request to mine it again, and the islanders are still debating it.":"你走过了 Makatea 的磷矿岁月：Temao 的铁轨和起重机、Vaitepaua 的面包房、矿坑和深处的水。从 {#1}年代到 {#2} 年，这里靠人工开采，岛上三分之一的土地从未得到修复；{#3} 年，政府同意研究一项重新开采的申请，岛民们至今仍在讨论。","Under the white cliffs of Moumu, the island’s climbing guide checks you before you leave the ground. <b>Check the three things</b>: harness buckled, helmet on, and the figure-eight knot tied through the harness.":"在 Moumu 的白色悬崖下，岛上的攀岩向导在你离开地面前为你做检查。<b>检查三件事</b>：安全带扣好、头盔戴上、八字结穿过安全带系好。","Figure-eight knot":"八字结","<b>Climb!</b> Tap the next handhold, the glowing one. Every third hold, a bolt: <b>clip</b> your rope into it before you go higher. Salt eats the bolts here, so the climbers check and replace them often.":"<b>开始攀登！</b>点击下一个发光的抓点。每隔三个抓点有一个挂片：继续往上之前，先把绳子<b>挂</b>进去。这里的海盐会腐蚀挂片，所以攀岩者会经常检查和更换。","Clip the rope":"挂绳","Not that one: take the glowing hold.":"不是那个：抓发光的那个。","A bolt. Clip in!":"一个挂片。挂绳！","Clip the rope into the bolt first: a fall above an unclipped bolt is a long one.":"先把绳子挂进挂片：在没挂绳的挂片上方坠落，会掉得很远。","Clipped. Keep going.":"挂好了。继续爬。","<b>The top!</b> From {#1} m up you see the sea all round, the green plateau, and on a clear day the line of Rangiroa’s motu to the north-west. Your guide lowers you down on the rope.":"<b>登顶！</b>从 {#1} 米高处，你能看到四周的大海、绿色的台地，天气晴朗时还能看到西北方 Rangiroa 的一串 motu。你的向导用绳子把你放下来。","You climbed a limestone cliff of Makatea with the island’s guide: harness, helmet and knot checked, the rope clipped at every bolt. About {#1} routes now line the cliffs, opened with the island’s climbing association; climbing, caving and a via ferrata bring visitors back to an island the mine had emptied.":"你和岛上的向导一起攀登了 Makatea 的一座石灰岩悬崖：安全带、头盔和绳结都检查过了，每个挂片都挂了绳。如今悬崖上有约 {#1} 条线路，是与岛上的攀岩协会一起开辟的；攀岩、洞穴探险和一条 via ferrata 让游客重新回到这座曾被矿山掏空的岛屿。","<b>{#1}. Choose the house.</b> A <b>fare pōteʻe</b> has rounded ends, like the old houses of the chiefs, rebuilt at Maeva on Huahine; a <b>fare hau pape</b> is rectangular.":"<b>{#1}. 选择房屋。</b><b>fare pōteʻe</b> 两端是圆的，就像古时酋长的房屋，在 Huahine 的 Maeva 已经重建；<b>fare hau pape</b> 则是长方形的。","<b>{#1}. Set the posts.</b> Hardwood posts of ʻaito, sunk deep in the coral ground. Tap each mark to stand a post.":"<b>{#1}. 立柱子。</b>用 ʻaito 硬木做柱子，深深埋进珊瑚地里。点击每个标记，立起一根柱子。","Set a post":"立柱子","<b>{#1}. Raise the ridge pole.</b> A long beam rests on a centre post at each end. Hold to lift it into place.":"<b>{#1}. 架起脊梁。</b>一根长梁两端各搁在一根中柱上。按住把它抬到位。","<b>{#1}. Lay the rafters.</b> Light poles of pūrau run from the wall plate up to the ridge.":"<b>{#1}. 铺椽子。</b>轻巧的 pūrau 木杆从檐檩一直架到屋脊。","Lay a rafter":"铺一根椽子","<b>{#1}. Lash every joint.</b> No nails: each joint sits in a notch and is bound with sennit, the cord of coconut fibre.":"<b>{#1}. 绑扎每个接头。</b>不用钉子：每个接头都卡在切口里，再用 sennit（椰纤绳）绑牢。","<b>{#1}. Thatch the roof.</b> Pandanus leaves, soaked in the lagoon, rolled flat and dried, are set on rods in panels. Lay them from the bottom up, each row over the one below, so the rain runs off.":"<b>{#1}. 铺茅草屋顶。</b>露兜树叶在泻湖里浸泡后压平晒干，再一片片固定在细杆上做成草片。从下往上铺，每一排压在下一排上面，这样雨水就能流下去。","Lay a row":"铺一排","A fare being built on the coral ground of Makatea, with the cliff behind":"一座正在 Makatea 珊瑚地上建造的 fare，背后是悬崖","A little locomotive":"一台小火车头","A long beam rests on a centre post at each end. Hold to lift it into place.":"一根长梁两端各搁在一根中柱上。按住把它抬到位。","A pandanus roof lasts about seven years before the panels are renewed. Open your fare from Makatea or your Passport: your instruments, jewellery and crafts are kept inside.":"露兜树屋顶大约能用七年，之后要更换草片。从 Makatea 或你的护照打开你的 fare：你的乐器、首饰和手工艺品都收藏在里面。","A white limestone cliff above the sea, with handholds and bolts":"海面上方的一座白色石灰岩悬崖，有抓点和挂片","At Temao, the only port, the cantilever loaded the ships that carried the phosphate away to be spread on the fields of other countries. Only its concrete footing and rusted iron remain.":"在唯一的港口 Temao，悬臂起重机把磷矿装上船，运往其他国家撒在田地里。如今只剩下它的混凝土底座和生锈的铁架。","Hardwood posts of ʻaito, sunk deep in the coral ground. Tap each mark to stand a post.":"用 ʻaito 硬木做柱子，深深埋进珊瑚地里。点击每个标记，立起一根柱子。","Light poles of pūrau run from the wall plate up to the ridge.":"轻巧的 pūrau 木杆从檐檩一直架到屋脊。","Makatea is one of the few Tuamotu islands with fresh water: under the old windmill a hole goes down about {#1} m to the water, and islanders drew drinking water in dark caves.":"Makatea 是 Tuamotu 群岛中少数有淡水的岛屿之一：在旧风车下面，一个洞向下约 {#1} 米通到水面，岛民们在幽暗的洞穴里打饮用水。","No nails: each joint sits in a notch and is bound with sennit, the cord of coconut fibre.":"不用钉子：每个接头都卡在切口里，再用 sennit（椰纤绳）绑牢。","Over {#1} people lived here in the {#2}s: Polynesians from other islands, and workers from Japan, then China and Vietnam. When the mine closed in {#3} almost everyone left in a few months.":"{#2}年代，这里住着超过 {#1} 人：有来自其他岛屿的波利尼西亚人，还有先后来自日本、中国和越南的工人。{#3} 年矿山关闭后，几个月内几乎所有人都离开了。","Pandanus leaves, soaked in the lagoon, rolled flat and dried, are set on rods in panels. Lay them from the bottom up, each row over the one below, so the rain runs off.":"露兜树叶在泻湖里浸泡后压平晒干，再一片片固定在细杆上做成草片。从下往上铺，每一排压在下一排上面，这样雨水就能流下去。","Small locomotives pulled the phosphate to the port on narrow rails, until a conveyor belt across almost half the island replaced them.":"小火车头沿着窄轨把磷矿拉到港口，后来一条横贯近半个岛的传送带取代了它们。","The bakery oven":"面包房的烤炉","The coral pillars crumble at the edges. Stay on the path with the guide.":"珊瑚岩柱的边缘会碎裂。请跟着向导走在小路上。","The crane at Temao":"Temao 的起重机","The ferns hide holes up to {#1} m deep. Stay on the path.":"蕨类植物遮住了深达 {#1} 米的坑。请走在小路上。","The holes":"矿坑","The phosphate lay between pillars of coral rock. Workers dug it out by hand, with shovels, buckets and wheelbarrows, leaving a maze of more than a million holes, some {#1} m deep.":"磷矿埋在珊瑚岩柱之间。工人们用铁锹、水桶和手推车靠双手挖出它，留下了由一百多万个坑组成的迷宫，有的深达 {#1} 米。","The ruins of Vaitepaua and Temao on the plateau of Makatea":"Makatea 台地上的 Vaitepaua 和 Temao 遗迹","The water hole":"水洞","The workers":"工人们","Vaitepaua was a company town: a bakery, a butcher, a laundry, a bistro, a cinema, and a dance troupe that won prizes against the other islands.":"Vaitepaua 曾是一座公司镇：有面包房、肉铺、洗衣房、小酒馆、电影院，还有一支在与其他岛屿的比赛中屡屡获奖的舞蹈团。","Your fare hau pape stands on the coral of Makatea, its long roof thatched with pandanus.":"你的 fare hau pape 立在 Makatea 的珊瑚地上，长长的屋顶铺着露兜树茅草。","Your fare pōteʻe stands on the coral of Makatea, its rounded ends thatched with pandanus.":"你的 fare pōteʻe 立在 Makatea 的珊瑚地上，圆形的两端铺着露兜树茅草。","Your boat comes in under the cliff of Temao, the only port, with the swell breaking at its foot. <b>Tap the three remains</b> the guide points to.":"你的船驶到唯一的港口 Temao 的悬崖下，涌浪在崖脚拍碎。<b>点击向导指出的三处遗迹</b>。","Climb to the town":"上山进镇","Up on the plateau, the company town is going back to the forest. Vines climb the walls, banyans push through the floors. <b>Tap the five remains.</b>":"台地上，这座公司镇正在重归森林。藤蔓爬上墙壁，榕树顶穿地板。<b>点击五处遗迹。</b>","Walk to the pits":"走向矿坑","Beyond the village the road ends in the mined plateau: islanders call it the Sahara. Thousands of round holes, about {#1} m across and {#2} to {#3} m deep, hidden by ferns. <b>Follow the stakes</b>: tap them in order to cross to the old windmill.":"村子外面，路的尽头就是被开采过的台地：岛民们叫它 Sahara。成千上万个圆坑，直径约 {#1} 米，深 {#2} 到 {#3} 米，被蕨类遮住了。<b>跟着木桩走</b>：按顺序点击它们，穿过台地走到旧风车。","<b>Stop!</b> Under the ferns that is a hole {#1} m deep. Follow the stakes.":"<b>停！</b>蕨类下面是一个 {#1} 米深的坑。跟着木桩走。","Not yet: take the stakes in order.":"还不行：按顺序走木桩。","Between two holes: mind the edge.":"两个坑之间：小心边缘。","Good. The pillars are only a step wide.":"很好。岩柱只有一步宽。","Keep to the stakes.":"沿着木桩走。","Nearly there.":"快到了。","Flat rock. Next stake.":"平坦的岩石。下一根木桩。","<b>The windmill.</b> Under it the deepest hole of all goes {#1} m down to the water table.":"<b>风车。</b>它下面是最深的一个坑，向下 {#1} 米直到地下水位。","{#1} / {#2} · The water hole":"{#1} / {#2} · 水洞","Makatea is one of the few Tuamotu islands with fresh water. Under the old windmill a hole goes <b>{#1} m</b> down to the water; islanders also drew water in the dark caves. <b>Hold</b> to lower the bucket.":"Makatea 是 Tuamotu 群岛中少数有淡水的岛屿之一。旧风车下面，一个洞向下 <b>{#1} 米</b>通到水面；岛民们也在幽暗的洞穴里打水。<b>按住</b>放下水桶。","Hold to lower the bucket":"按住放下水桶","Cool, clear water comes up in the bucket. Your guide pours some for you, then looks across the Sahara: “Our grandparents dug all this by hand. Some of us want the mine back for the work; others want the holes left to the ferns and the crabs.”":"清凉透亮的水随着水桶升了上来。向导给你倒了一些，然后望向 Sahara 的另一头：“这一切都是我们的祖父母用双手挖出来的。我们当中有人希望矿山回来，好有活干；也有人希望把这些坑留给蕨类和螃蟹。”","The miners dug the phosphate out of the holes with…":"矿工们把磷矿从坑里挖出来，用的是……","Big excavators":"大型挖掘机","Dynamite":"炸药","Shovels, buckets and wheelbarrows, by hand":"铁锹、水桶和手推车，靠双手","There were no machines in the pits: shovels, buckets and wheelbarrows, then a train and later a conveyor to the port.":"矿坑里没有机器：靠铁锹、水桶和手推车，然后由火车、后来由传送带运到港口。","No explosives: the phosphate was soft sand between hard coral pillars, dug out by hand.":"没有用炸药：磷矿是坚硬珊瑚岩柱之间的松软砂土，靠人工挖出来。","Yes. A man was lowered into the hole, filled buckets, and his team hauled them up on ropes. Board ramps led into the shallower pits.":"没错。一个人被放进坑里装满水桶，同伴们再用绳子把桶拉上来。较浅的坑则搭着木板坡道通进去。","You walked through the phosphate years of Makatea: the gangway and the crane footing of Temao, the ramp with its rails, the overgrown town of Vaitepaua with its locomotive, its workshop, its oven and the director’s house, then the Sahara and its thousands of holes, to the water hole under the windmill. Mined by hand from the {#1}s to {#2}, a third of the island was never restored; in {#3} the government agreed to study a request to mine it again, and the islanders are still debating it.":"你走过了 Makatea 的磷矿岁月：Temao 的栈桥和起重机底座、带铁轨的坡道、草木丛生的 Vaitepaua 镇和它的火车头、车间、烤炉和矿长的房子，然后是 Sahara 和它成千上万个坑，直到风车下的水洞。从 {#1}年代到 {#2} 年，这里靠人工开采，岛上三分之一的土地从未得到修复；{#3} 年，政府同意研究一项重新开采的申请，岛民们至今仍在讨论。","<b>{#1}. Choose the house.</b> A <b>fare pōteʻe</b> has rounded ends, like the old houses of the chiefs rebuilt at Maeva on Huahine; a <b>fare hau pape</b> is rectangular.":"<b>{#1}. 选择房屋。</b><b>fare pōteʻe</b> 两端是圆的，就像古时酋长的房屋，在 Huahine 的 Maeva 已经重建；<b>fare hau pape</b> 则是长方形的。","<b>{#1}. Clear the ground.</b> Coral stones and ferns come out, and the ground is levelled with coral gravel. <b>Tap the four stones.</b>":"<b>{#1}. 清理地面。</b>把珊瑚石和蕨类清掉，再用珊瑚碎石把地面整平。<b>点击四块石头。</b>","<b>{#1}. Dig and set the posts.</b> Five posts of ʻaito, the ironwood, with a notch cut at the top. Tap each mark to dig the hole and stand the post.":"<b>{#1}. 挖坑立柱。</b>五根 ʻaito 铁木柱子，顶端切出凹口。点击每个标记，挖坑并立起柱子。","<b>{#1}. Raise the ridge pole.</b> A long beam must go up level onto the two centre posts. <b>Tap Left and Right</b> in turn so one end never gets ahead of the other.":"<b>{#1}. 架起脊檩。</b>一根长梁要水平地抬上两根中柱。<b>轮流点击“左端”和“右端”</b>，别让一端超前另一端。","◀ Left end":"◀ 左端","Right end ▶":"右端 ▶","Level it: lift the other end.":"放平：抬另一端。","A little higher.":"再高一点。","Halfway up.":"到一半了。","Nearly on the posts.":"快搁到柱子上了。","<b>{#1}. Lay the rafters.</b> Light poles of pūrau from the wall plate up to the ridge, one side then the other.":"<b>{#1}. 铺椽子。</b>轻巧的 pūrau 木杆从檐檩一直架到屋脊，先一侧，再另一侧。","<b>{#1}. Lash every joint.</b> No nails: each joint sits in its notch and is bound with nape, the cord of coconut fibre. <b>Hold</b> on each post to wrap it.":"<b>{#1}. 捆扎每个接头。</b>不用钉子：每个接头都卡在凹口里，再用 nape（椰纤绳）捆牢。在每根柱子上<b>按住</b>把它缠好。","<b>{#1}. Thatch the roof.</b> Pandanus leaves soaked in the lagoon, rolled flat and dried, sewn on rods in panels. <b>Tap the rows from the bottom up</b>, each over the one below, so the rain runs off.":"<b>{#1}. 铺茅草屋顶。</b>露兜树叶在泻湖里浸泡后压平晒干，再缝在细杆上做成草片。<b>从下往上点击每一排</b>，每一排压在下一排上面，这样雨水就能流下去。","From the bottom up: each row covers the one below, so the rain runs off.":"从下往上：每一排盖住下面一排，这样雨水就能流下去。","A door of woven pandanus, a floor of coral gravel under mats: your fare is finished. The old roofs of the chiefs went up the same way, post by post, joint by joint.":"一扇露兜叶编的门，草席下铺着珊瑚碎石的地面：你的 fare 完工了。古时酋长们的屋顶也是这样搭起来的，一根柱子接一根柱子，一个接头接一个接头。","A fare being built on the coral ground of Makatea, with the white cliff and the forest behind":"一座正在 Makatea 珊瑚地上建造的 fare，背后是白色悬崖和森林","You passed that one.":"那一个你已经过了。","has rounded ends, like the old houses of the chiefs, rebuilt at Maeva on Huahine; a":"两端是圆的，就像古时酋长的房屋，在 Huahine 的 Maeva 已经重建；","The port of Temao under the cliff, the overgrown town of Vaitepaua, and the mined plateau of Makatea":"悬崖下的 Temao 港、草木丛生的 Vaitepaua 镇，以及 Makatea 被开采过的台地","On the reef platform under the white cliff of <b>Moumu</b>, the island’s guide checks you before you leave the ground. The sea breaks at your feet and the forest waits {#1} m above. <b>Check the four things.</b>":"在白色的 <b>Moumu</b> 悬崖下的礁石平台上，岛上的向导在你离地前为你做检查。海浪在你脚下拍碎，森林在 {#1} m 高处等着你。<b>检查这四样东西。</b>","Rope signals agreed":"约定好绳索信号","Buckled and doubled back: the guide pulls on it to check.":"扣好并回穿：向导拉一拉来检查。","Small stones and bits of dead coral can fall from the top.":"顶上可能会掉下小石子和死珊瑚碎片。","A figure-eight through both loops of the harness, with a long tail.":"用八字结穿过安全带的两个环，留出长长的绳尾。","<b>Climb!</b> The rings show the holds within reach: <b>choose one</b>. Not every hold is good on Makatea. Pockets and crimps pump your forearms: when the bar turns red, <b>shake out</b> on a big hold. At each bolt, <b>clip</b> before going higher.":"<b>攀登！</b>圆圈标出你够得着的岩点：<b>选一个</b>。在 Makatea，并不是每个岩点都好抓。指洞和小边会让你的前臂充血：当条变红时，在大岩点上<b>甩手休息</b>。每到一个挂片，先<b>挂绳</b>再往上爬。","The swell breaks under the cliff and covers your voices: three tugs on the rope will mean “I am safe at the top”.":"涌浪在悬崖下拍碎，盖过你们的声音：拉绳三下就表示“我已安全到顶”。","<b>Black rock.</b> It looks like a good hold, but it is razor-sharp: it cuts fingers and can cut the rope in a fall. The local guides warn about it. Take the white rock.":"<b>黑色岩石。</b>它看起来像个好岩点，但它像刀一样锋利：会割伤手指，坠落时还可能割断绳子。当地向导都会提醒这一点。请抓白色岩石。","A jug: a big hold you can rest on.":"大把手：一个可以让你休息的大岩点。","<b>It rings hollow and moves.</b> A loose flake could break and fall on your guide below. Leave it and use another hold.":"<b>敲起来是空的，还会动。</b>松动的岩片可能断裂，砸到下面的向导。别碰它，换一个岩点。","<b>A ledge, {#1} m up.</b> You can stand and let your arms rest. At the other end a brown noddy sits on its nest: keep your feet away. Look out to sea: a <b>humpback whale</b> blows offshore. From late June to October they pass close to the cliffs.":"<b>岩架，离地 {#1} m。</b>你可以站稳，让手臂休息。另一头有一只白顶玄燕鸥正卧在巢里：脚离它远一点。望向大海：一头<b>座头鲸</b>在远处喷水。从六月下旬到十月，它们会从悬崖附近经过。","Climb on":"继续攀登","Rested. The colonnettes start above the ledge: pinch them.":"休息好了。岩架上方开始出现小石柱：捏住它们。","A colonnette: you pinch the little column with your whole hand.":"小石柱：用整只手捏住这根小石柱。","Look at the bolt":"看看挂片","A bolt by your hand, but something is wrong with it. Look before you clip.":"手边有一个挂片，但它不太对劲。挂绳前先看一看。","Rust on the hanger: the salt air eats metal here. You brush it and look: the bolt is still sound. You will <b>tell the association</b> tonight, so they replace it.":"挂片片上有锈：这里带盐的空气会腐蚀金属。你擦了擦，仔细看：挂片还很牢固。今晚你会<b>告诉协会</b>，让他们更换。","<b>The roof.</b> The rock leans out over you. Your feet swing out into the air. Swing, and <b>reach</b> when your swing carries you towards the lip on the right.":"<b>屋檐。</b>岩壁向外倾斜，悬在你头顶。你的双脚荡到空中。荡起来，当摆动把你带向右边的屋檐边缘时，<b>伸手去抓</b>。","Reach!":"伸手！","<b>The lip!</b> You catch it at the end of the swing and pull over the roof.":"<b>屋檐边缘！</b>你在摆到尽头时抓住了它，翻过了屋檐。","<b>The anchor.</b> Two titanium bolts and a ring, just under the forest, {#1} m above the sea. <b>Clip in</b> to the anchor.":"<b>保护站。</b>两个钛合金挂片和一个环，就在森林下方，离海面 {#1} m。<b>挂入</b>保护站。","<b>Safe at the top.</b> Now your guide must know it, far below on the reef. How do you tell them?":"<b>安全到顶。</b>现在得让你的向导知道，向导远在下面的礁石上。你要怎么告诉对方？","Shout “Safe!”":"喊“安全！”","Three tugs on the rope":"拉绳三下","You shout, but the swell booms in the notch under the cliff: your guide hears nothing. Use the signal you agreed.":"你大喊，可涌浪在悬崖下的海蚀凹槽里轰鸣：你的向导什么也听不见。用你们约定好的信号。","<b>Three tugs.</b> Far below, your guide answers with three tugs. Turn round: the ocean all round, the reef in pink and white along the foot of the cliffs, the green plateau behind you with its pits and its fan palms. Now the way down: <b>hold to let the rope slide</b> through your descender, and let go to stop. Go gently.":"<b>拉三下。</b>在远远的下方，你的向导也拉三下回应你。转过身来：四周都是大海，悬崖脚下的礁石一片粉白，身后是绿色的台地，满是坑洞和扇叶棕榈。现在下降：<b>按住让绳子滑动</b>穿过下降器，松开就停下。慢慢来。","Let the rope slide":"让绳子滑动","{#1} m · Speed":"{#1} m · 速度","<b>Too fast!</b> Your guide pulls the rope from below and you stop. Let it slide gently: the rope burns on your hand and on the rock.":"<b>太快了！</b>你的向导在下面拉住绳子，你停了下来。让绳子慢慢滑：绳子会磨伤你的手，也会磨损岩石。","On the outer cliff of Makatea the via ferrata ends at a <b>zip line</b> that runs along the cliff, high above the reef. The guide checks you on the platform at the top. <b>Get ready</b>: four things are right, one is dangerous.":"在 Makatea 的外侧悬崖上，铁索攀登的终点是一条沿悬崖延伸的<b>滑索</b>，高高悬在礁石上方。向导在顶上的平台为你做检查。<b>做好准备</b>：有四样是对的，一样是危险的。","Helmet strap closed":"头盔带已扣好","Harness tight":"安全带已系紧","Pulley on the cable":"滑轮挂在钢索上","Safety lanyard on the cable":"安全挂绳挂在钢索上","Hand on the cable in front of the pulley":"手放在滑轮前方的钢索上","<b>Never!</b> The pulley would run over your fingers. Both hands stay on the strap, under the pulley.":"<b>绝对不行！</b>滑轮会碾过你的手指。双手都要握在吊带上，在滑轮下方。","Closed under the beak: the helmet stays on even in a gust.":"扣在喙下：即使刮阵风，头盔也戴得稳稳的。","Buckled and tight round the waist and the legs.":"扣好了，紧紧系在腰部和腿部。","The pulley sits on the cable, its gate closed and locked.":"滑轮挂在钢索上，锁门已关好并锁上。","<b>Ready.</b> Sit back in the harness and step off the platform. On the line: <b>hold Tuck</b> to go faster, <b>hold Spread wings</b> to slow down: open wings and legs catch the air. Watch the guide on the end platform, and tap what you see on the way: birds, and the sea below.":"<b>准备好了。</b>坐进安全带里，从平台上迈出去。在滑索上：<b>按住“收紧”</b>可以加速，<b>按住“展开翅膀”</b>可以减速：张开的翅膀和双腿会兜住空气。留意终点平台上的向导，并点击你在途中看到的东西：鸟儿，还有下面的大海。","Step off":"迈出去","<b>You are flying!</b> The cliff on your left, the reef {#1} m below, the ocean to the horizon. Hold Tuck or Spread wings; tap what you see.":"<b>你在飞！</b>悬崖在你左边，礁石在下方 {#1} m，大海一直延伸到天边。按住“收紧”或“展开翅膀”；点击你看到的东西。","Tuck":"收紧","Spread wings":"展开翅膀","Brown noddies nest on the ledges of the cliff.":"白顶玄燕鸥在悬崖的岩架上筑巢。","A pair of white terns hovers by the line: they lay their single egg on a bare branch.":"一对白燕鸥在滑索旁盘旋：它们把唯一的一枚蛋产在光秃秃的树枝上。","A frigatebird hangs on the wind, high above the cliff.":"一只军舰鸟乘着风，悬停在悬崖高处。","A humpback whale blows offshore: they pass Makatea from late June to October.":"一头座头鲸在远处喷水：从六月下旬到十月，它们会经过 Makatea。","The guide on the platform spreads his arms wide: <b>spread your wings</b> and slow down!":"平台上的向导张开双臂：<b>展开翅膀</b>减速！","<b>A soft arrival.</b> You come in at {#1} km/h, the brake takes you gently, and the guide catches your strap. Now get off the line, in the right order.":"<b>轻柔着陆。</b>你以 {#1} km/h 的速度到达，制动器把你稳稳停住，向导抓住了你的吊带。现在按正确的顺序离开滑索。","Take the pulley off the cable":"把滑轮从钢索上取下","Clip your lanyard to the platform line":"把你的挂绳挂到平台安全绳上","Not yet: first clip yourself to the platform line. You are never unclipped above the drop.":"还不行：先把自己挂到平台安全绳上。在落差上方，你绝不能处于未挂保护的状态。","Clipped to the platform. Now the pulley can come off.":"已挂到平台上。现在可以取下滑轮了。","<b>A ledge, {#1} m up.</b> You can stand and let your arms rest. At the other end a brown noddy sits on its nest: keep your feet away. Look out to sea: a <b>sea turtle</b> surfaces near the reef. From October to March turtles nest on the beaches of Temao and Moumu, so climbers keep away from them.":"<b>岩架，离地 {#1} m。</b>你可以站稳，让手臂休息。另一头有一只白顶玄燕鸥正卧在巢里：脚离它远一点。望向大海：一只<b>海龟</b>在礁石附近浮出水面。从十月到次年三月，海龟在 Temao 和 Moumu 的海滩上筑巢，所以攀岩者会远离它们。","<b>Your forearms give!</b> You were not clipped yet: you land on the reef beside your guide. Start again, and clip the first bolt.":"<b>你的前臂撑不住了！</b>你还没挂绳：你掉落在礁石上，落在向导身边。重新开始，记得挂上第一个挂片。","<b>Your forearms give!</b> You fall, and the rope goes tight on the last bolt you clipped. Shake out, then climb again.":"<b>你的前臂撑不住了！</b>你坠落了，绳子在你最后挂的那个挂片上绷紧。甩手休息，然后继续攀登。","No rest here: shake out on a jug or a big hole you can hang from.":"这里没法休息：到大把手或能挂住身体的大洞上甩手休息。","A big hole in the rock: you can rest here.":"岩石上的一个大洞：你可以在这里休息。","A crimp: fingertips only, it pumps.":"小边：只能用指尖，前臂会充血。","<b>A small plant is flowering in this pocket.</b> Some plants of Makatea grow nowhere else, and the climbers’ guide asks everyone to leave them alone. Find another hold.":"<b>这个指洞里有一株小植物正在开花。</b>Makatea 的一些植物在别处都没有，攀岩者指南请大家不要碰它们。换一个岩点。","Too early: you are swinging away from the lip. Wait for it.":"太早了：你正在荡离屋檐边缘。等一等。","Almost: wait until the swing is at its end, in the green.":"差一点：等摆动到尽头、进入绿色区域时再抓。","The guide waves you on: your speed is fine.":"向导挥手示意你继续：你的速度正好。","<b>You stopped short</b> and roll back to the lowest point of the cable. It happens to everyone who slows down too early. <b>Pull yourself</b> hand over hand along the cable to the platform.":"<b>你停得太早了</b>，又滑回到钢索的最低点。减速太早的人都会这样。用双手交替<b>把自己拉</b>到平台。","<b>Bang!</b> At {#1} km/h the spring brake stops you hard and you swing up under the cable. Safe, but next time spread your wings when the guide spreads his arms. Now get off the line, in the right order.":"<b>砰！</b>以 {#1} km/h 的速度，弹簧制动器把你猛地刹住，你被甩起来荡到钢索下方。你很安全，但下次向导张开双臂时，要展开翅膀。现在按正确的顺序离开滑索。","<b>You reach the platform</b> hand over hand. The guide grabs your harness. Now get off the line, in the right order.":"你双手交替，<b>到达了平台</b>。向导抓住你的安全带。现在按正确的顺序离开滑索。","A sea turtle in the clear water by the reef: turtles nest at Temao and Moumu from October to March.":"礁石边清澈的水里有一只海龟：从十月到次年三月，海龟在 Temao 和 Moumu 筑巢。","Seen from behind the manu, the white limestone cliff of Moumu rises from the reef to the forest; to the right the cliff turns away into the distance and the ocean opens to the horizon":"从 manu 身后看去，Moumu 的白色石灰岩悬崖从礁石一直升到森林；右边的悬崖向远处退去，大海一直延伸到天边","Seen through the manu's eyes, hanging under the zip line: the white cliff of Makatea on the left, the reef and the ocean below and on the right, the end platform ahead":"透过 manu 的眼睛，挂在滑索下方：左边是 Makatea 的白色悬崖，下方和右边是礁石和大海，前方是终点平台","<b>{A}:</b> {B}. You stayed calm, so they stayed a moment longer.":"<b>{A}：</b>{B}。你保持冷静，所以它们多停留了一会儿。","<b>{A}</b>: {B}. Into the crate.":"<b>{A}</b>：{B}。放进箱子。","Current: flowing IN, toward the lagoon <span></span>":"水流：正流入潟湖 <span></span>","Current: flowing OUT, toward the ocean <span></span>":"水流：正流向大海 <span></span>","<span></span> OCEAN":"<span></span> 大洋","Current: flowing OUT <span></span>":"水流：向外流 <span></span>","Current: flowing IN <span></span>":"水流：向内流 <span></span>","<span></span> a sea-urchin spine":"<span></span> 一根海胆刺","<span></span> a piece of coral":"<span></span> 一块珊瑚","<span></span> a bit of seashell":"<span></span> 一小片贝壳","<span></span> a pink foraminifera shell":"<span></span> 一个粉色的有孔虫壳","<span></span> coral ground by a parrotfish":"<span></span> 被鹦嘴鱼磨碎的珊瑚","<span></span> Left end":"<span></span> 左端","Right end <span></span>":"右端 <span></span>"});
